## Competitor Landscape

Competitor: Aptos
Category: Move L1 Blockchain
Difference: Aptos adalah Layer 1 independen dengan MoveVM native; Movement adalah modular stack (SDK + MoveVM + MEVM) targeting Ethereum L2 settlement dan multi-chain interoperability via Movement Network
Market Segment: Move ecosystem / Smart Contract Platform
Sources: https://aptosfoundation.org/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: Sui
Category: Move L1 Blockchain (Object-centric Move)
Difference: Sui menggunakan Move object model dan consensus Narwhal/Tusk; Movement menggunakan MoveVM dengan EVM compatibility (MEVM) dan Ethereum settlement
Market Segment: Move ecosystem / Smart Contract Platform
Sources: https://sui.io/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: 0L (Zero Layer)
Category: Move Community / Open-source Move Tooling
Difference: 0L adalah komunitas open-source mengembangkan Move toolchain standar; Movement adalah commercial entity membangun proprietary MoveVM/MEVM/SDK di atas upstream Move toolchain
Market Segment: Move ecosystem / Developer Tooling
Sources: https://0l.network/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://github.com/movementlabsxyz

Competitor: Arbitrum
Category: Ethereum L2 (Optimistic Rollup)
Difference: Arbitrum menggunakan EVM-equivalent execution (Nitro); Movement menggunakan MoveVM dengan MEVM compatibility layer, parallel execution, dan formal verification
Market Segment: Ethereum L2 Scaling
Sources: https://arbitrum.io/, https://l2beat.com/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: Optimism
Category: Ethereum L2 (Optimistic Rollup / OP Stack)
Difference: Optimism menggunakan EVM-equivalent (OP Stack); Movement menggunakan MoveVM dengan modular DA options dan MEVM untuk EVM compatibility
Market Segment: Ethereum L2 Scaling / Modular Stack
Sources: https://optimism.io/, https://l2beat.com/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: Base
Category: Ethereum L2 (OP Stack / Optimistic Rollup)
Difference: Base dibangun di atas OP Stack oleh Coinbase; Movement membangun custom MoveVM stack dengan modular architecture
Market Segment: Ethereum L2 Scaling
Sources: https://base.org/, https://l2beat.com/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: Celestia
Category: Modular Data Availability Layer
Difference: Celestia menyediakan DA layer; Movement mengintegrasikan Celestia sebagai DA option untuk Movement rollups — hubungan complementary bukan direct competitor
Market Segment: Modular Blockchain Stack
Sources: https://celestia.org/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: Polygon Avail
Category: Modular Data Availability Layer
Difference: Avail menyediakan DA layer; Movement mengintegrasikan Avail sebagai DA option — complementary relationship
Market Segment: Modular Blockchain Stack
Sources: https://www.availproject.org/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Competitor: EigenDA
Category: Modular Data Availability Layer (EigenLayer restaking)
Difference: EigenDA menyediakan DA via EigenLayer; Movement mengintegrasikan EigenDA sebagai DA option — complementary relationship
Market Segment: Modular Blockchain Stack / Restaking
Sources: https://eigenlayer.xyz/eigenda, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

## Narrative Position

Narrative: Modular Blockchain
Status: Main Narrative
Evidence: Movement Labs secara eksplisit memposisikan diri sebagai "Move-based modular blockchain stack" dengan pemisahan execution (MoveVM), settlement (Ethereum), DA (pluggable Celestia/Avail/EigenDA), dan sequencing (decentralized planned)
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Narrative: MoveVM / Move Language Ecosystem
Status: Main Narrative
Evidence: Produk inti Movement adalah MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK — semua berbasis Move language; positioning sebagai "bringing Move to Ethereum" via MEVM
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://movementlabs.xyz/products

Narrative: Ethereum L2 Scaling
Status: Main Narrative
Evidence: M1 dirancang sebagai Move-based L2 pada Ethereum dengan settlement di Ethereum L1; MEVM memungkinkan Ethereum dApps migrasi ke MoveVM
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/

Narrative: EVM Compatibility / EVM Equivalence
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: MEVM (Move-EVM compatibility layer) memungkinkan Solidity contracts berjalan di MoveVM tanpa modifikasi; mendukung Hardhat/Foundry tooling
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/

Narrative: Parallel Execution
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: MoveVM mendukung parallel execution berbasis dependency graph (mirip Block-STM) untuk throughput tinggi
Sources: https://movementlabs.xyz/products, https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Narrative: Formal Verification
Status: Secondary Narrative
Evidence: MoveVM terintegrasi dengan Move Prover untuk formal verification smart contracts
Sources: https://movementlabs.xyz/products, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/

Narrative: Interoperability / Cross-chain Messaging
Status: Secondary Narrative (Planned)
Evidence: Movement Network direncanakan untuk cross-chain messaging antar Move chains; detail protokol belum dipublikasikan
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Narrative: Restaking / EigenLayer Integration
Status: Secondary Narrative (Planned)
Evidence: EigenDA integration direncanakan sebagai DA option; tidak ada native restaking narrative untuk Movement token
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Narrative: AI / DePIN / Gaming / RWA / Intent / Chain Abstraction
Status: Tidak diterapkan (tidak ada positioning eksplisit dalam narasi ini)
Evidence: Blog visi dan dokumentasi teknis tidak menyebutkan vertical-specific narrative ini
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/, https://docs.movementlabs.xyz/

## Market Timeline

Date: 2022
Milestone: Pendirian Movement Labs
Description: Rushi Manche dan Cooper Scanlon mendirikan Movement Labs untuk membangun modular blockchain stack berbasis MoveVM
Related Historical Event ID: EV-001
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Date: 2022
Milestone: Inkorporasi Movement Labs Inc. (Delaware C-Corp)
Description: Legal entity formation untuk fundraising dan operasi
Related Historical Event ID: EV-002
Sources: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/movement-labs

Date: 2024
Milestone: Series A Funding $38M
Description: Pembiayaan Series A untuk pengembangan Movement SDK, M1, dan ekosistem
Related Historical Event ID: EV-006
Sources: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/movement-labs

Date: 2024
Milestone: Public Launch Announcement (Blog Post)
Description: Pengumuman resmi Movement Labs, Movement SDK, M1, Movement Network, MoveVM, MEVM
Related Historical Event ID: EV-007
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Date: 2024-07-30
Milestone: Parthenon Testnet Launch (MEVM Testnet)
Description: Testnet publik pertama untuk MoveVM, MEVM, Movement SDK tooling
Related Historical Event ID: EV-009
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-the-mevm-testnet-parthenon/

Date: 2024
Milestone: DA Layer Integration Announcements (Celestia, Avail, EigenDA)
Description: Roadmap integrasi modular DA layer untuk Movement Network dan M1
Related Historical Event ID: EV-010
Sources: https://blog.movementlabs.xyz/introducing-movement-labs-building-the-move-based-modular-blockchain-stack/

Date: Belum terjadwal
